& [Solution]
  + add one admission variant to existing journal and host unions
  + replay and execute that variant only through the P4 gate
  + let the existing typed MCP schema mutex and durable snapshot transaction carry it unchanged

& [Boundary] is transport and custody of a supplied Judgment record, not performance of Judgment
